{
"file": 964,
"paths": [
"d008/d113/f020"
],
"lines": [
{
"n": 0,
"h": "0e87675e",
"en_raw": "Excuse me"
},
{
"n": 1,
"h": "f86c2713",
"en_raw": "Oh, Sango"
},
{
"n": 2,
"h": "56989f9b",
"en_raw": "What'll it be today?"
},
{
"n": 3,
"h": "4d23bf77",
"en_raw": "Not 100 g of chicken wings"
},
{
"n": 4,
"h": "c5f5a380",
"en_raw": "today, um..."
},
{
"n": 5,
"h": "52d17952",
"en_raw": "It's about the old man"
},
{
"n": 6,
"h": "c469e416",
"en_raw": "that's the topic"
},
{
"n": 7,
"h": "881776d1",
"en_raw": "My grandpa?"
},
{
"n": 8,
"h": "f54fced5",
"en_raw": "Was he bothering someone?"
},
{
"n": 9,
"h": "8bb000ab",
"en_raw": "It's not that"
},
{
"n": 10,
"h": "3d188575",
"en_raw": "exactly, but"
},
{
"n": 11,
"h": "aaca5187",
"en_raw": "the famous strolling old man"
},
{
"n": 12,
"h": "0d92f6ee",
"en_raw": "was this shop's Grandpa"
},
{
"n": 13,
"h": "7c618205",
"en_raw": "Ah, but, Grandpa"
},
{
"n": 14,
"h": "0ffd7003",
"en_raw": "is gone now"
},
{
"n": 15,
"h": "c2279aed",
"en_raw": "Had his funeral the other day..."
},
{
"n": 16,
"h": "b75e99bc",
"en_raw": "Thanks for caring"
},
{
"n": 17,
"h": "15b4f3c7",
"en_raw": "He gave us so much trouble before"
},
{
"n": 18,
"h": "f4778cac",
"en_raw": "but now that he's gone"
},
{
"n": 19,
"h": "6903bfbe",
"en_raw": "it's a bit lonely"
},
{
"n": 20,
"h": "66ae2a38",
"en_raw": "...People are selfish, huh"
},
{
"n": 21,
"h": "e6bee6fe",
"en_raw": "Oh, Hirauchi"
},
{
"n": 22,
"h": "fe89ed61",
"en_raw": "isn't it?"
},
{
"n": 23,
"h": "7b66740c",
"en_raw": "Walking Murase's dog?"
},
{
"n": 24,
"h": "f37afd26",
"en_raw": "...Is that story famous?"
},
{
"n": 25,
"h": "223ab197",
"en_raw": "Well, kind of"
},
{
"n": 26,
"h": "a82b251d",
"en_raw": "I only"
},
{
"n": 27,
"h": "0794458f",
"en_raw": "really, truly, coincidentally"
},
{
"n": 28,
"h": "fb3904ee",
"en_raw": "ran into these two"
},
{
"n": 29,
"h": "70147efa",
"en_raw": "Okay, I'll go with that"
},
{
"n": 30,
"h": "45de326b",
"en_raw": "See you, Murase"
},
{
"n": 31,
"h": "c93bcfb4",
"en_raw": "Tomorrow at school"
},
{
"n": 32,
"h": "f86c2713",
"en_raw": "Oh, Sango"
},
{
"n": 33,
"h": "f7981dfd",
"en_raw": "Excuse me, may I?"
},
{
"n": 34,
"h": "b2610665",
"en_raw": "what is it?"
},
{
"n": 35,
"h": "091f68f8",
"en_raw": "Um, ma'am"
},
{
"n": 36,
"h": "eda5ab0e",
"en_raw": "the old man's strolls"
},
{
"n": 37,
"h": "a0bf9895",
"en_raw": "always went"
},
{
"n": 38,
"h": "3da9a386",
"en_raw": "strolling old men?"
},
{
"n": 39,
"h": "78e3090f",
"en_raw": "Where Grandpa used to go?"
},
{
"n": 40,
"h": "8b117f14",
"en_raw": "...I think he just"
},
{
"n": 41,
"h": "6550871e",
"en_raw": "made rounds of the area"
},
{
"n": 42,
"h": "f8834c8f",
"en_raw": "Hey, do you know?"
},
{
"n": 43,
"h": "13db6c6d",
"en_raw": "He's probably still keeping it up"
},
{
"n": 44,
"h": "272dbe0f",
"en_raw": "So our Grandpa"
},
{
"n": 45,
"h": "d8566db1",
"en_raw": "was famous after all"
},
{
"n": 46,
"h": "5786fde3",
"en_raw": "Oh, here you are"
},
{
"n": 47,
"h": "12abae10",
"en_raw": "What'll it be today?"
},
{
"n": 48,
"h": "826cacb3",
"en_raw": "I just have something"
},
{
"n": 49,
"h": "5880dfe6",
"en_raw": "I want to confirm"
},
{
"n": 50,
"h": "fa142a72",
"en_raw": "That old man's..."
},
{
"n": 51,
"h": "6e8a5fe0",
"en_raw": "What is it?"
},
{
"n": 52,
"h": "42d30d41",
"en_raw": "...Never mind"
},
{
"n": 53,
"h": "c2298bd4",
"en_raw": "Sorry to bother you"
},
{
"n": 54,
"h": "2478e9d9",
"en_raw": "I'll advertise your fried chicken"
},
{
"n": 55,
"h": "27a5a76b",
"en_raw": "as the best in class"
},
{
"n": 56,
"h": "b7fc25af",
"en_raw": "That'd be a help"
},
{
"n": 57,
"h": "463c889f",
"en_raw": "Um, this is sudden"
},
{
"n": 58,
"h": "d7173074",
"en_raw": "how about fresh-fried crab cream croquettes?"
},
{
"n": 59,
"h": "eefc58cd",
"en_raw": "...80 yen"
},
{
"n": 60,
"h": "56f5ec18",
"en_raw": "No, that's not it"
},
{
"n": 61,
"h": "651d272a",
"en_raw": "Do you know there's a grave behind"
},
{
"n": 62,
"h": "70e5517e",
"en_raw": "the realtor at Hirumi Station's north exit?"
},
{
"n": 63,
"h": "49a2f587",
"en_raw": "A grave behind? What's that?"
},
{
"n": 64,
"h": "b11de2df",
"en_raw": "It was written Yamamoto Something Koji"
},
{
"n": 65,
"h": "6bfd57bb",
"en_raw": "but..."
},
{
"n": 66,
"h": "76b4ff42",
"en_raw": "Ah, that one!"
},
{
"n": 67,
"h": "6f40436a",
"en_raw": "That's my older brother"
},
{
"n": 68,
"h": "7d4e0059",
"en_raw": "I knew it..."
},
{
"n": 69,
"h": "581382dd",
"en_raw": "But why?"
},
{
"n": 70,
"h": "1dc95d81",
"en_raw": "Is it strange?"
},
{
"n": 71,
"h": "18725193",
"en_raw": "We're Yamamoto, after all"
},
{
"n": 72,
"h": "9443022f",
"en_raw": "The shop's Takagiya, though..."
},
{
"n": 73,
"h": "513a5418",
"en_raw": "But where did"
},
{
"n": 74,
"h": "6d9a1de0",
"en_raw": "that name come from?"
},
{
"n": 75,
"h": "724143e0",
"en_raw": "When I followed the old man-ish"
},
{
"n": 76,
"h": "80bc4130",
"en_raw": "person's strolling route..."
},
{
"n": 77,
"h": "8543817a",
"en_raw": "My... dad?"
},
{
"n": 78,
"h": "55e12497",
"en_raw": "......."
},
{
"n": 79,
"h": "94a9b628",
"en_raw": "Sorry, right now"
},
{
"n": 80,
"h": "b8a2882c",
"en_raw": "I'd rather not discuss that"
},
{
"n": 81,
"h": "0e87675e",
"en_raw": "Excuse me"
},
{
"n": 82,
"h": "81bf42f3",
"en_raw": "Ah, thanks for yesterday"
},
{
"n": 83,
"h": "79670840",
"en_raw": "Sorry, right now"
},
{
"n": 84,
"h": "c5283482",
"en_raw": "I don't plan to talk about anything"
}
]
}